Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedras de Mardin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:17.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...comecei a pensar que ela era minha, minha legítima esposa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:32.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.79,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:49.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu procurei seu pai, filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me falar com você também.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.47,0:08:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu também não consegui falar, provavelmente não está funcionando onde ele está.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.34,0:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa o rádio comunicador, então!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:40.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Você já sabe que tem o rádio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:45.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele sabe, mãe, por que você não sabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, você conhece muito a sua bicicleta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.07,0:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que nunca está à vontade, será que é o medo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:05.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.99,0:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que ficou calado, então, por que não nos pergunta nada?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran pediu assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:21.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran pediu assim, hein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:25.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.79,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele disse: "Se um dia eu não morrer, guarde-me".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:28.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.99,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou contar agora, vocês já sabem o motivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:29.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também escondi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.71,0:09:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.24,0:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós nos conhecemos com Boran na Bulgária.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:51.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.29,0:09:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estava na escuridão, ele estava fugindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:52.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.87,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não perguntei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:53.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.07,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava claro nos olhos dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:55.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,O passado era pesado.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:58.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ajudei-o a sair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.98,0:10:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois eu também me meti nessa confusão.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrei em conflito com a máfia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:04.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugimos para o Canadá, nós dois.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.37,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele abriu um restaurante, e eu fui me envolver com ele, então.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No começo, ele era distante.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.02,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, passou a confiar em mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.20,0:10:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um dia ele perguntou: "Quer ser meu segurança?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele sobreviveu e saiu com vida, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava desmaiada, não viu nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:42.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.54,0:10:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No dia do atentado, eu estava logo no carro de trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No meu próprio veículo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.14,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um dos meus homens estava comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.49,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois da colisão, corremos para lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:53.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.39,0:10:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya estava desacordada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não viu absolutamente nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran estava gravemente ferido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Colocamos o Boran no meu carro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.73,0:11:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, parti a cabeça do homem ao meu lado com uma alavanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dei ao rosto dele uma aparência irreconhecível.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:09.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.94,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Öner Bakır.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:11.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.69,0:11:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Exatamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O marido da mulher que vocês estão interrogando.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.46,0:11:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tirei as roupas dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Peguei a identidade dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:21.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vesti o Boran com as roupas do Ömer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:22.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentei a Dona Alya ao lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Coloquei a identidade do Boran no bolso dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:27.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dei ao Boran a identidade usando as roupas do Ömer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:29.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ele ainda não havia despertado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:31.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.22,0:11:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamei a ambulância.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.28,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Avisei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois me afastei dali com o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Para onde eu o levei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o internou em um hospital particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou em coma por um curto período.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.21,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, ele ficou em estado vegetativo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:52.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.32,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você ficou calado sobre isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você não nos avisou? Diga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já tinha dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:56.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.58,0:11:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele disse para não falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:57.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.70,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Os que o seguem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:00.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não sabe se ele vai viver ou não.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:01.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.11,0:12:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também fiquei calado.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:03.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.23,0:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Eee?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, para onde eu voltei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:05.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu tempo no Canadá acabou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando vim, eu também o trouxe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:12.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tudo dê certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:13.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele reconhece? Você viu alguma vez?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:14.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.86,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ele não reconhece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.05,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Infelizmente, há um silêncio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:24.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós o levaremos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Os que estão no leito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:29.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhora Tabakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.45,0:13:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada Ali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.89,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.18,0:13:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem que contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.27,0:13:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,É difícil dizer, mas pode não sobreviver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos mantê-lo vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.28,0:13:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos mantê-lo vivo com sua própria força.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez voltemos aos antigos saberes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.87,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser, querida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.43,0:14:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser, Deus aumentará.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.77,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós também faremos o que pudermos, claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:08.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu vi como está.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.20,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer, não sabemos quanto tempo isso vai durar nem o que pode acontecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é como um filho para mim, vá.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:23.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.19,0:14:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:28.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.78,0:14:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Boran sobreviver, se recuperar, então você conta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.42,0:14:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, não diga agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso, por favor, olha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.49,0:14:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você contar, todo mundo vai atrás dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:38.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Polícia, os Baybars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.41,0:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal, Boran matou Süleyman Baybars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo menos vamos esconder em outro lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:46.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém além de nós saberá.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.02,0:14:50.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cale a boca, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:28.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.22,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém além de você sabe que ele está vivo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Den, ninguém além de Erol vai saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.08,0:16:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrume o avião, façam os preparativos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.36,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos levar Boran para Mardin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse trabalho é comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele pegou, eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.97,0:16:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo na Davre, continuaremos na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:28.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.05,0:16:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, irmão, para a empresa não ter problemas, eles vão ver, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:30.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Que conversa fiada?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.87,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,De outro jeito não dá para proteger, que fique à vista.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:34.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.52,0:16:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos levar à noite para dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:35.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.27,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Silencioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.15,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Desça aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:44.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.68,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Só você sabe o que passou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Já deixa isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Amarre isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã, minha curiosa filhinha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos secar isso ao sol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:24.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No inverno, vamos rechear e comer juntos, com prazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:24.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.17,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.99,0:17:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Se for pipoca, então.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.39,0:17:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer que eu pendure, Cihan? Se quiser, eu penduro, claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:29.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistimos no filme.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:31.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos comer o milho crocante, pode ser?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão comendo? Mostrem o crocante.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.99,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está comendo, crocante?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:40.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.79,0:17:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, vamos comer milho, mas quando eles quebram estalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:41.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.59,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:42.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.71,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocrante.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Essas coisas são eternas, o que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:47.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.02,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhora Sadakat, estávamos fazendo os preparativos de inverno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:49.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.82,0:17:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dissemos que devemos ser rápidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.36,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,É a sua vez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aniversário de falecimento da Sra. Bora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:54.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não tem nada a ver com ela.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.62,0:17:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhora Sadakat, ainda faltam dois anos, mas vamos resolver isso, se Deus quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos começar agora, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:17:59.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai você.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:17:59.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.30,0:17:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.92,0:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, Senhora Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:01.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.98,0:18:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem, vamos ver, ele também.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, é a morte do meu pai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, venha, vamos conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:09.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.19,0:18:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A patrulha do seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:13.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.91,0:18:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Não contou à mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:16.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora vamos conversar, avó.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:16.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.16,0:18:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.98,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não contou, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele mesmo parece ter esquecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:23.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakize!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:24.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.93,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pode pegar o Deniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.52,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:31.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O que significa esquecer, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:33.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.16,0:18:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que eu esqueceria?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:34.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.99,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode-se esquecer algo assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão tentando dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:38.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.73,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo tem seu tempo, Senhora Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:38.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.28,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a mãe dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.42,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu decido quando e sobre o que vamos conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:42.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei o momento certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.84,0:18:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que vocês vêm aqui procurando uma oportunidade para ferir meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.34,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Que oportunidade?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:47.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Que mentira você está contando?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:49.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.66,0:18:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não contou ao garoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:50.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:52.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.45,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está chamando o tio Cihan de pai agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:53.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.79,0:18:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, de jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:54.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não é seu verdadeiro pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:55.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.55,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu pai é Oran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:56.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.67,0:18:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, o que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.21,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês estão dizendo que há alguém que nega isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:00.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que vocês estão gritando?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem alguém que nega, Sadakat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia para fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:06.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.85,0:19:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, assim não dá, saia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem você pensa que é para me dar ordens, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vejam, eu fiquei calado sobre o caso da Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:15.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.20,0:19:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu coração ardia, minha consciência sangrava, eu fiquei calado, mas não por vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:20.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.06,0:19:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei calado por causa da sua família, desta casa, de Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:24.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.64,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não vou ouvir ninguém; irei à polícia se vocês não saírem, saiam para fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:27.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.86,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Se continuarem com isso, eu denuncio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:28.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.05,0:19:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está ameaçando Seme.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou sair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:38.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.57,0:19:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não por medo, e sim porque penso no meu neto, eu vou sair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.23,0:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão ficar pensando demais, saiam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:47.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Você, você...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:52.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.12,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Olá, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.14,0:19:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês chegaram cedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.58,0:19:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:56.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.26,0:19:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:58.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Senti sua falta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.18,0:20:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,De novo. Vamos fazer um café e beber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.02,0:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bebendo muito café. Eu preparei comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.21,0:20:05.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.33,0:20:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Coma, eu cuido do resto. Tudo bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:08.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.77,0:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não quer? Onde está Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:18.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.48,0:20:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinceramente, não sei. Acabou de sair e foi embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.31,0:20:21.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,O que significa saiu e foi? Você disse alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.65,0:20:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você fez de novo, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:25.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Porra, olha pra mim. Você não sabe nada de mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:28.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não se mete em confusão, mashallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.76,0:20:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro, eu perguntei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.92,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não te conheço, não?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro, eu perguntei. Ele ficou me olhando como um boi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele saiu correndo. O que eu faço?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:38.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Se vai me desafiar, cuida da sua barriga, hein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:39.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.04,0:20:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, irmã.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:44.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.77,0:20:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez ele não tenha conseguido aceitar que a mãe dele seja assassina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:48.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.48,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não teve coragem de nos olhar, nos largou e foi embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.74,0:20:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Em silêncio total.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.10,0:20:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:52.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomara, meu Deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:56.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pra onde ele vai sem avisar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:57.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.97,0:20:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Liga agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:58.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.00,0:20:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde ele está?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrependa-se, Resulallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:07.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.34,0:21:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:13.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.43,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde você está, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:15.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei à mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:16.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.71,0:21:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você foi à mansão?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu conto depois, pode ser? Falamos depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:23.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.55,0:21:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não avisou que ia sair?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:26.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu precisava avisar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a gente passou, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:30.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.21,0:21:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O que estamos vivendo, pelo amor de Deus? Não finja que esqueceu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.71,0:21:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,E se eles não te deixarem sair de lá?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:36.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.66,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, se não voltar em uma hora, eu vou ficar batendo na porta, entendeu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:40.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.47,0:21:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, eu vou voltar. Certo. Por favor. Por favor, fica calmo. Eu volto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:42.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.65,0:21:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Como eu fico calmo? Estou preocupado com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:44.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.21,0:21:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, a gente conversa depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Naci.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.08,0:22:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem? Seja bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:08.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.27,0:22:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, seja bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.56,0:22:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim conversar com a minha mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:12.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.53,0:22:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim conversar com a Mine.
