Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.76,0:22:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele fez, não fez?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele matou a Mine, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.06,0:22:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, filha, eu fiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:28.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.88,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:30.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, como você fez isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:37.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.07,0:22:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, como você conseguiu fazer isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:40.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.01,0:22:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Filha, por que você está agindo como se estivesse surpresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:41.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.08,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem me chamou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Então por que você me chamou, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu liguei para o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:47.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.90,0:22:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu liguei para o meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.92,0:22:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te liguei porque não consegui alcançar eles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te liguei porque fui obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:53.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, foi obrigada?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:54.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.80,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não me conhece, filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:59.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.00,0:22:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não sabia como eu iria parar aquela mulher?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabia tudo, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:06.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.14,0:23:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando o Ecmel, que você conhece melhor, descobriu que era pai do Bora.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:10.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.84,0:23:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele iria virar um inferno, não é, filha?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:12.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.89,0:23:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Então você não poderia ficar ao lado do Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:14.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.09,0:23:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não aguentou, não é?
