Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquela mulher precisava ser parada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:19.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.36,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.69,0:23:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Agradeça por me acusar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:24.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, todo mundo está falando que você é assassina.
