Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Então você fará o que for necessário, filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.04,0:24:52.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.16,0:24:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai voltar para a nossa mansão, ou então desapareça, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:56.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.45,0:24:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, por favor, não faça.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:20.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.05,0:25:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vai acontecer com Mevlüt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:25.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.92,0:25:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, Nare, minha querida Nare, venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:29.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere, segure‑se... por favor, não fique parada tanto assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:30.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:29.83,0:25:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem?
