Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.31,0:25:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomara que eu não tenha encontrado motivo de preocupação.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.51,0:25:40.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.63,0:25:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei, eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.71,0:25:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde estão meus irmãos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:48.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.29,0:25:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão está na Síria.
