Dialogue: 1,2:18:33.73,2:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Como isso aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.50,2:18:35.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:34.62,2:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não consegue respirar?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.49,2:18:36.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:35.61,2:18:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,O que isso quer dizer? Não entendi.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.63,2:18:37.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:36.75,2:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chame o médico imediatamente.
