Dialogue: 1,2:18:48.30,2:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,O médico está chegando.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.82,2:18:49.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:48.94,2:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, acalmem‑se.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.12,2:18:54.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:52.24,2:18:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Leve o Hakisi, irmã da Sevda.
