Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.73,2:19:33.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:30.85,2:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora é a vez do casamento, senhor Salih.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.39,2:19:34.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:33.51,2:19:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Silêncio.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.33,2:19:36.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:35.45,2:19:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.59,2:19:37.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:36.71,2:19:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dissemos algo errado?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.78,2:19:42.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:38.90,2:19:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensamos que, justamente num dia tão doloroso como este, seria bom refrescar nossos corações.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.80,2:19:45.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:42.92,2:19:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Além disso, quem fez a proposta foi a senhora Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.52,2:19:47.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:45.64,2:19:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse a İpek que conversaríamos sobre esse assunto.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.53,2:19:49.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:47.65,2:19:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Um minuto, eu não disse nada assim.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.77,2:19:52.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:49.89,2:19:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que conversaríamos, não falei nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.93,2:19:53.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:52.05,2:19:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Um minuto, um minuto.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.09,2:19:54.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:53.21,2:19:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está chorando?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.10,2:19:55.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:54.22,2:19:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não entendi, então.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.28,2:19:57.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:55.40,2:19:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o que há, Sr. Salih?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.00,2:19:57.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:57.12,2:19:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,De onde ele apareceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.72,2:19:58.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:57.84,2:19:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso será um casamento.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.64,2:19:59.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:58.76,2:19:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.70,2:20:00.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:19:59.82,2:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.44,2:20:01.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:00.56,2:20:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega, tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.52,2:20:03.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:02.64,2:20:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai recuar.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.10,2:20:05.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:04.22,2:20:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sr. Salih.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.77,2:20:07.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:05.89,2:20:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai recuar, o casamento será realizado.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.62,2:20:09.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:07.74,2:20:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não vamos falar disso hoje.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.15,2:20:10.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:10.27,2:20:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamais.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.06,2:20:12.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:11.18,2:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado novamente.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.94,2:20:13.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:12.06,2:20:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.50,2:20:13.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:12.62,2:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.99,2:20:18.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:14.11,2:20:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ömür, minha filha, me faça uma água com limão. Vamos, minha pressão subiu.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.97,2:20:19.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:18.09,2:20:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos conversar sobre isso, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.91,2:20:19.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:19.03,2:20:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou morrer.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.83,2:20:20.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:19.95,2:20:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.89,2:20:22.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:21.01,2:20:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem logo, Boran está mal.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.09,2:20:23.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:22.21,2:20:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, corre, algo aconteceu.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.76,2:20:29.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:26.88,2:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.09,2:20:35.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:32.21,2:20:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Um problema com a entrega surgiu e precisamos voltar imediatamente à empresa.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.78,2:20:38.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:35.90,2:20:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo? Preciso de algo rápido.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.34,2:20:39.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:20:38.46,2:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, cunhada.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.90,2:21:31.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:21:29.02,2:21:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem algum assunto?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:03.26,2:22:03.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:03.38,2:22:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde eles estão?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:03.86,2:22:05.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:03.98,2:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, eles desceram.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.35,2:22:06.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:05.47,2:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, vamos, saia.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.36,2:22:08.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:06.48,2:22:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um momento, não posso largar agora. Minha reunião está lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.66,2:22:09.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:08.78,2:22:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kadir, saia.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.79,2:22:11.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:09.91,2:22:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, saia já. Olha, não fique aí.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.18,2:22:18.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:13.30,2:22:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quebrem essa porta. O que vocês estão aprontando aqui dentro?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.79,2:22:21.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:20.91,2:22:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.30,2:22:22.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:21.42,2:22:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra a porta!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.30,2:22:23.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:22.42,2:22:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, que negócio você tem aqui?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.30,2:22:24.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:23.42,2:22:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, abra a porta!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.30,2:22:25.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:24.42,2:22:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem é o Şahin aqui?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.30,2:22:27.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:25.42,2:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.87,2:22:28.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:26.99,2:22:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.09,2:22:29.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:28.21,2:22:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, abram essa porta!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.09,2:22:30.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:29.21,2:22:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.09,2:22:31.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:30.21,2:22:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, eu forcei.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.09,2:22:32.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:31.21,2:22:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Filho, abra essa porta!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.09,2:22:33.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:32.21,2:22:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos arrebentar!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.06,2:22:34.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:33.18,2:22:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, vocês vão se dar mal!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.06,2:22:36.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:34.18,2:22:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O nível de oxigênio havia caído.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.12,2:22:37.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:36.24,2:22:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Trocamos a máscara.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.12,2:22:39.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:37.24,2:22:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Limpamos o concentrador de respiração.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.12,2:22:42.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:39.24,2:22:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Também administramos soro de suporte.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.82,2:22:43.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:41.94,2:22:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Por enquanto nossa situação está estável.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.82,2:22:45.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:22:42.94,2:22:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, está bem vivo.
